      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "`catalog` is a Go service with **no tracing code**. Beyla attaches eBPF probes to the process, reads the incoming `traceparent` header and emits HTTP server spans plus Postgres client spans. Everything on this page comes from those spans or from Beyla's own metrics.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "What you are looking at",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
